sequenceDiagram
    participant App as "Application<br/>startup"
    participant Spring as "Spring Boot<br/>Environment"
    participant Props as "application.yml<br/>spring.datasource / jpa"
    participant AutoCfg as "Spring Boot<br/>DataSource autoconfig"
    participant Hikari as "HikariDataSource(bean)"
    participant JPA as "Spring Data JPA / Hibernate"

    App->>Spring: start
    Spring->>Props: read datasource & jpa properties
    Spring->>AutoCfg: bind & create DataSource
    AutoCfg->>Hikari: create HikariDataSource
    Hikari->>JPA: used by EntityManager / Repositories
    Note right of JPA: Schema validation / dialect: PostgreSQL
